[[What is art anyway?|What is Art Anyway?]]

Artists are people who produce creative or imaginative works… this often means painting, drawing, sculpting, [[designing|Design]], performing, dancing, music playing, etc.

See [[Designer]], [[Author]], [[Four Steps for an Artistic Practice]], [[What Artists Need to Know About Copyright]], [[Mingei]]

* [[A designer is an emerging synthesis of artist, inventor, mechanic, objective economist and evolutionary strategist]]
* [[To find a form that accommodates the mess, that is the task of the artist now.]]

